{"words": [{"text": "وَمَنْ", "translation": "And who"}, {"text": "أَظْلَمُ", "translation": "(is) more unjust"}, {"text": "مِمَّن", "translation": "than (one) who"}, {"text": "مَّنَعَ", "translation": "prevents"}, {"text": "مَسَـٰجِدَ", "translation": "(the) masajid"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "يُذْكَرَ", "translation": "be mentioned"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in them"}, {"text": "ٱسْمُهُۥ", "translation": "His name"}, {"text": "وَسَعَىٰ", "translation": "and strives"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "خَرَابِهَآ ۚ", "translation": "their destruction"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "it is"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "يَدْخُلُوهَآ", "translation": "they enter them"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "خَآئِفِينَ ۚ", "translation": "(like) those in fear"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "For them"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "the world"}, {"text": "خِزْىٌۭ", "translation": "(is) disgrace"}, {"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "translation": "and for them"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "translation": "the Hereafter"}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "translation": "(is) a punishment"}, {"text": "عَظِيمٌۭ", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "And who are more unjust than those who prevent the name of Allāh from being mentioned [i.e., praised] in His mosques and strive toward their destruction. It is not for them to enter them except in fear. For them in this world is disgrace, and they will have in the Hereafter a great punishment."}